#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_partner_relationship_blocklist
msgid ""
"\n"
"Blocklist proximity\n"
"===================\n"
"\n"
"``l10n_mx_partner_blocklist`` marks a contact that is itself on the SAT 69-B\n"
"definitive list. A listed taxpayer reappearing as a relative's company is\n"
"invisible to that check, which is the shape the problem usually takes.\n"
"\n"
